## shadcn/ui Guidelines

### Component Usage
- Always use shadcn/ui components from `@/components/ui/`
- Extend shadcn components when needed, don't modify source
- Use `cn()` utility for conditional className merging
- Follow shadcn's variant patterns with `cva` (class-variance-authority)

### Component Patterns
```tsx
// Button example with variants
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';

<Button 
  variant="default" 
  size="lg"
  className="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500"
>
  Action
</Button>
```

### Available Components
- Use `Button`, `Dialog`, `Dropdown`, `Select`, `Tabs`, `Toast` from shadcn
- Create custom components in `components/` that compose shadcn primitives
- Maintain shadcn's accessibility standards (ARIA, keyboard navigation)

